'''Cyrus''' (Japanese: '''アカギ''' ''Akagi'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Switch in 1 of your opponent's Benched Pokémon that has damage on it to the Active Spot.
}}

