==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Boss's Orders}} and {{TCG|Lysandre}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card can only switch in a Pokémon with damage on it.
** Cyrus is one of the characters who has been featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Boss's Orders|132}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game.
** This card's effect is also somewhat similar to the Item card {{TCG|Toy Catcher}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, which can switch in any Pokémon with 50 remaining HP or less.
* Cyrus's Japanese name, Akagi, is also the name of [[akagi (illustrator)|this card's illustrator]].
===Origin===
*[[Cyrus]] is the boss of [[Team Galactic]] and the main antagonist of {{game2|Diamond|Pearl|Platinum}}.
*The uncommon print of this card shows Cyrus in front of [[Team Galactic HQ]] in [[Veilstone City]].

